{"id":"torrey:diet-of-the-jews-the","source":"torrey","name":"Diet Of The Jews, The","slug":"diet-of-the-jews-the","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"In patriarchal age — Ge 18:7,8; 27:4.","refs":[["Gen",18,7,18,7],["Gen",18,8,18,8],["Gen",27,4,27,4]]},{"text":"In Egypt — Ex 16:3; Nu 11:5.","refs":[["Exod",16,3,16,3],["Num",11,5,11,5]]},{"text":"In the wilderness — Ex 16:4-12.","refs":[["Exod",16,4,16,12]]},{"text":"Of the poor, frugal — Ru 2:14; Pr 15:17.","refs":[["Ruth",2,14,2,14],["Prov",15,17,15,17]]},{"text":"Of the rich, luxurious — Pr 23:1-3; La 4:5; Am 6:4,5; Lu 16:19.","refs":[["Prov",23,1,23,3],["Lam",4,5,4,5],["Amos",6,4,6,4],["Amos",6,5,6,5],["Luke",16,19,16,19]]},{"text":"Milk. — Ge 49:12; Pr 27:27.","refs":[["Gen",49,12,49,12],["Prov",27,27,27,27]]},{"text":"Butter. — De 32:14; 2Sa 17:29.","refs":[["Deut",32,14,32,14],["2Sam",17,29,17,29]]},{"text":"Cheese. — 1Sa 17:18; Job 10:10.","refs":[["1Sam",17,18,17,18],["Job",10,10,10,10]]},{"text":"Bread. — Ge 18:5; 1Sa 17:17.","refs":[["Gen",18,5,18,5],["1Sam",17,17,17,17]]},{"text":"Parched corn. — Ru 2:14; 1Sa 17:17.","refs":[["Ruth",2,14,2,14],["1Sam",17,17,17,17]]},{"text":"Flesh. — 2Sa 6:19; Pr 9:2.","refs":[["2Sam",6,19,6,19],["Prov",9,2,9,2]]},{"text":"Fish. — Mt 7:10; Lu 24:42.","refs":[["Matt",7,10,7,10],["Luke",24,42,24,42]]},{"text":"Herbs. — Pr 15:17; Ro 14:2; Heb 6:7.","refs":[["Prov",15,17,15,17],["Rom",14,2,14,2],["Heb",6,7,6,7]]},{"text":"Fruit. — 2Sa 16:2.","refs":[["2Sam",16,2,16,2]]},{"text":"Dried fruit. — 1Sa 25:18; 30:12.","refs":[["1Sam",25,18,25,18],["1Sam",30,12,30,12]]},{"text":"Honey. — Song 5:1; Isa 7:15.","refs":[["Song",5,1,5,1],["Isa",7,15,7,15]]},{"text":"Oil. — De 12:17; Pr 21:17; Eze 16:13.","refs":[["Deut",12,17,12,17],["Prov",21,17,21,17],["Ezek",16,13,16,13]]},{"text":"Vinegar. — Nu 6:3; Ru 2:14.","refs":[["Num",6,3,6,3],["Ruth",2,14,2,14]]},{"text":"Wine. — 2Sa 6:19; Joh 2:3,10.","refs":[["2Sam",6,19,6,19],["John",2,3,2,3],["John",2,10,2,10]]},{"text":"Water. — Ge 21:14; Mt 10:42.","refs":[["Gen",21,14,21,14],["Matt",10,42,10,42]]},{"text":"Expressed by bread and water — 1Ki 13:9,16.","refs":[["1Kgs",13,9,13,9],["1Kgs",13,16,13,16]]},{"text":"Generally prepared by females — Ge 27:9; Pr 31:15; Isa 8:13.","refs":[["Gen",27,9,27,9],["Prov",31,15,31,15],["Isa",8,13,8,13]]},{"text":"In the morning, sparingly. — Jdj 19:5; Ec 10:16,17.","refs":[["Judg",19,5,19,5],["Eccl",10,16,10,16],["Eccl",10,17,10,17]]},{"text":"At noon. — Ge 43:16; Joh 4:6,8.","refs":[["Gen",43,16,43,16],["John",4,6,4,6],["John",4,8,4,8]]},{"text":"In the evening. — Ge 24:11,33; Lu 24:29,30.","refs":[["Gen",24,11,24,11],["Gen",24,33,24,33],["Luke",24,29,24,29],["Luke",24,30,24,30]]},{"text":"Often sitting. — Ge 27:19; 43:33.","refs":[["Gen",27,19,27,19],["Gen",43,33,43,33]]},{"text":"Often reclining. — Am 6:4; Joh 13:23.","refs":[["Amos",6,4,6,4],["John",13,23,13,23]]},{"text":"With the hand. — Mt 26:23; Lu 22:21.","refs":[["Matt",26,23,26,23],["Luke",22,21,22,21]]},{"text":"Thanks given before — Mr 8:6; Ac 27:35.","refs":[["Mark",8,6,8,6],["Acts",27,35,27,35]]},{"text":"Purification before — 2Ki 3:11; Mt 15:2.","refs":[["2Kgs",3,11,3,11],["Matt",15,2,15,2]]},{"text":"A hymn sung after — Mt 26:30.","refs":[["Matt",26,30,26,30]]},{"text":"Men and women did not partake of together — Ge 18:8,9; Es 1:3,9.","refs":[["Gen",18,8,18,8],["Gen",18,9,18,9],["Esth",1,3,1,3],["Esth",1,9,1,9]]},{"text":"Articles of, often sent as presents — 1Sa 17:18; 25:18,27; 2Sa 16:1,2.","refs":[["1Sam",17,18,17,18],["1Sam",25,18,25,18],["1Sam",25,27,25,27],["2Sam",16,1,16,1],["2Sam",16,2,16,2]]}],"refCount":80}
